  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/herengracht.json \u2014 RoomSpec for the quay outside the house (the Herengracht at night), modelled after openly licensed reference photos of the canal: the house fronts on our side (ours among them, its own windows lit from inside), the cobbled street, bare elms, Amsterdammertjes, bikes, a houseboat, the canal and the far bank, a hump bridge with lamps round its arches. Outdoor: no walls or roof of its own (street.py builds the world). Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things). Units: metres, Y up, north = -Z; placed in the house at \"origin\".",
